{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792003920, "covers_from": "2026-10-14T18:52:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-14T18:53:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792003980, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-14T18:52:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 34372, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "食安", "content": "我是大安區家長，希望趕快改善食安問題，讓孩子能吃的安心～", "display_name": "大安代表 Yunya", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T18:52:09+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 2062, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "育兒", "content": "很擔心孩子的學習環境受暴", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.2,062", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T18:52:14+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 24974, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "做生意的要在大安區生存很困難\n\n一天到晚檢舉噪音 \n希望能有個平衡 我們含淚關門了", "display_name": "大安代表 No.24,974", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T18:52:28+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 19491, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "路上邊走邊抽菸還是一大堆、煙蒂還亂丟路上/水溝，又髒又臭快被燻死了，希望能有改善", "display_name": "中正代表 No.19,491", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T18:52:40+00:00", "duration_seconds": 20, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 12393, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "交通", "content": "公車是交通的微血管，台灣的公車永遠都開的急急忙忙的，而且資訊很不清楚，請參考隔壁日本的照抄即可。", "display_name": "萬華代表 Ethan 亞月(李冠億)", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 2062, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.2,062", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 24974, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.24,974", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true,